look material
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
# NOTE: earlier result: Material tertiary/primary container palette differed (Rust peach vs QML light yellow); fixed? report if still different.
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
key 9*9
wait 1
shot sh-99
note Tertiary hero with "81", caption "Enter copies it", copy icon; selected hero is fully round (corners 50 percent).
rec sh-down 0.6 key -k Down
note Hero corners go back to 28 in about 0.22 s (about 6 frames at 30 fps); compare with QML within 1 frame.
wait 1
shot sh-down-end
note Hero not selected: corners 28, not round.
rec sh-up 0.6 key -k Up
note Hero round again when selected; same timing as QML.
wait 1
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 glide 1272 328 300
wait 1
shot sh-go-hover
note Go button hovered: 8 percent layer.
rec sh-go-press 0.4 ptr move 1272 328 down
note Press on the go button: corners to 16 with a slight swell.
ptr move 1272 328 up
wait 1
shot sh-go-copied
note Release copies 81 and closes Search.
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
key foot
wait 1
shot sh-foot
note Top Hit hero in primaryContainer, foot icon on a cookie12 shape, arrow-up-right icon; palette as QML.
key -k Return
wait 2
shot sh-foot-launched
note Return launched foot (a terminal window is visible) and Search closed.
setup pkill -x foot || true
